ut  authenticity for me and i don't want to  ever  put a story out there that doesn't  reflect me and my values and so for me  um i was very clear about that i think  the viewers see that um and it was it  was the only way i was ever going to  tell my story so yeah yeah  doing it my way telling it my way that  was definitely my decision and that was  the only way i was ever going to do it  again  you know it's  really difficult to sometimes get so  open raw and personal because you know  millions of people around the world are  watching you and following you and  listening to the things that you have to  say what have other women uh in specific  come up to you and said about watching  your journey on the show  women have had an outpouring of love for  me and to say that i'm humbled by it is  an understatement they are just so kind  and so um inspired they say by seeing my  representation on television and they  they call me confident and um a woman  who knows how to set boundaries they  aspire to do the same but i have to say  that the fans the viewers that inspire  me the most are the the girl dads i  actually posted to my social media  recently this long text from this father  of two 15 year old girls who are half  south asian themselves and he said i  love that they see you on television i  love that and they have a book that they  can they can hold and talk to me about  he's like we all bought our own copies  about three copies we're not sharing can  you imagine this dad this dad of two  teenagers um wants his daughters to  reflect me and wanted to read my story  alongside them they have a book club in  their family i was like i was literally  bawling i was like can i share this on  my social media you made this experience  right here all worth it  that is incredible and that's the power  of being a writer and being honest and  vulnerable and open and that's what  you're doing yeah  you are still looking for love we're not  going to spoil anything but you are  still looking for love uh you know this  is et canada maybe your partner is  living in canada somewhere who knows so  i want to know  three words  what three words are you looking for in  a future partner  that's tough um kind  communicative  and  inquisitive  those are great three words thank you i  just came up with them oh it's awesome  because most people would be like funny  cute but no that's right inquisitive is  yeah that's great i mean if a partner  from indian matchmaking said those words  you would know you would know she was  struggling  uh how do you hope to inspire people by  once again  appearing on indian matchmaking and do  you think people will continue to  connect with your story  um i've already in the past you know  week heard from so many people who have  connected with it so many women of color  have expressed to me that setting  boundaries is really hard for them and  so for me to go on the show and say i'll  continue to share my stories but on my  terms as uncomfortable as that may be  for me at times and that's been a really  powerful statement for them and a really  powerful illustration for them and so i  just think that that has been incredible  to watch and see um happen over the past  you know week already and who knows  what's to come who knows what's to come  maybe season three who knows  i can't say either way who knows you  know the final question i want to ask  you and i think it's an important one  because it's difficult to find a partner  i consider myself lucky i've been in a  relationship with my partner for  almost 15 years now which is insane to  me  but do you still believe in love do you  believe that there is somebody out there  for you  yeah 100  there is not a doubt in my mind and i  know that i'm going to meet them very  soon um i say this  very often i'm so happy right now i'm  happy building a life that i love and i  think that that has created even more  space for the perfect partner to come  walking through the door so um i'm here  and i'm ready and uh let's see what you  know the next  few months or the next year um has in  store for me  well we love you we love seeing your  story and we want you to find love  congratulations on the book as well you  are doing amazing things and you know  having that representation out there  from somebody like yourself is  incredibly important for so many people  so thank you for that it was a blast  chatting and uh hopefully season three  always  thank you so much thank you
 

